{"chapter": 691, "provider": "SUCCESS", "schema": [], "delta": {"new_relationships": [{"ozne": "Sunny", "iliski": "bulundugu_yer", "nesne": "Altar Island", "kanit": "Sunny remained silent for a few moments, absorbing what Noctis had told him. The Altar Island was calm and tranquil, the lake surrounding it shimmering in the darkness with the reflected moonlight.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Nether", "iliski": "unvani", "nesne": "Prince of the Underworld", "kanit": "’Huh... so the Prince of the Underworld was actually called Nether? I wonder which came first, the name or the title... and he was also the Demon of Destiny, it seems.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Nether", "iliski": "unvani", "nesne": "Demon of Destiny", "kanit": "Then there is the youngest, Nether — the Demon of Destiny, who secluded himself in the darkness of the Underworld.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Nether", "iliski": "turu", "nesne": "daemon", "kanit": "The daemons, you see, are elusive and solitary creatures by nature. There is the eldest, mysterious Weaver — the Demon of Fate, who is shrouded in countless layers of lies. Then there is the youngest, Nether — the Demon of Destiny, who secluded himself in the darkness of the Underworld.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Hope", "iliski": "unvani", "nesne": "Demon of Desire", "kanit": "Or at least they were, until the Demon of Desire decided to come and live among us mortals, becoming known as Hope.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Demon of Oblivion", "iliski": "turu", "nesne": "daemon", "kanit": "The daemons, you see, are elusive and solitary creatures by nature. There is the eldest, mysterious Weaver — the Demon of Fate, who is shrouded in countless layers of lies. Then there is the youngest, Nether — the Demon of Destiny, who secluded himself in the darkness of the Underworld. There is the Demon of Oblivion, whose name is long forgotten...", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}], "new_aliases": [], "relationship_updates": [], "state_changes": [], "identity_revelations": [], "contradictions": [], "new_entities": [], "review_items": []}, "counters": {"already_known_proposals": 0, "deterministic_same_chapter_duplicates": 0, "same_chapter_existing_proposals": 1, "unsupported_state_keys": 0, "new_entity_candidates": 0, "direction_errors": 0, "high_impact_evidence_failures": 0, "unsupported_review_items": 0}}
